          "no": 1,
          "en": "CONCEPT",
          "title": "先读懂专业概念",
          "html": "<figure class=\"cuttings-background\" style=\"margin:20px 0;border:1px solid #ccded6;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#f9fcfa\">\n<style>\n.cuttings-background{color:#294d45;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.cb-header{padding:24px 26px 12px}.cb-header h3{font-size:23px!important;margin:5px 0 8px!important;color:#244d43!important}.cb-header p{font-size:13px!important;color:#6c827b;margin:0!important}.cb-motion{margin:6px 7px 18px 27px;accent-color:#278d79}.cuttings-background label{font-size:12px;color:#3d7868;cursor:pointer}.cb-viewport{overflow-x:auto;padding:0 14px}.cb-viewport>svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:780px;font-family:inherit}.cb-flow{stroke-dasharray:5 12;animation:cb-circulate 1.7s linear infinite;animation-play-state:paused}.cb-motion:checked~.cb-viewport .cb-flow{animation-play-state:running}.cb-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:22px;padding:22px 26px;border-top:1px solid #dce8e2}.cb-grid h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#305a4c;font-size:14px}.cb-grid p{margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#70867e}.cb-lag{margin:0 26px 22px;border-top:1px solid #d5e5dc;padding-top:16px}.cb-lag summary{cursor:pointer;color:#2b7d69;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.cb-lag>p{font-size:12px;color:#6d857a;line-height:1.9}.cb-lag svg{width:100%;min-width:620px;display:block}.cb-source{padding:0 26px 20px;font-size:11px;color:#81968c;line-height:1.8}.cb-source a{color:#548c7b}.cb-key{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#5e9985}@keyframes cb-circulate{to{stroke-dashoffset:-34}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cuttings-background .cb-flow{animation:none}}@media(max-width:600px){.cb-header{padding:18px}.cb-header h3{font-size:19px!important}.cb-grid{padding:18px}.cb-lag{margin:0 18px 18px}.cb-source{padding:0 18px 18px}}\n.cuttings-background{padding:0!important;background:#f9fcfa!important}.cuttings-background .cb-viewport>svg{height:auto!important;max-height:none!important}.cuttings-background .cb-lag svg{height:auto!important;max-height:none!important}\n</style>\n<div class=\"cb-header\"><span class=\"cb-key\">FIELD TO IMAGE / 从井下到模型输入</span><h3>一份岩屑样品，怎样成为可识别的图像？</h3><p>沿着流体、样品与数据三条线，读懂岩屑识别前必须完成的工作。</p></div>\n<input class=\"cb-motion\" id=\"cb-motion\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><label for=\"cb-motion\">循环流动示意（取消勾选可暂停）</label>\n<div class=\"cb-viewport\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"岩屑来源与样品处理详图，窄屏可横向查看\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 530\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"cb-title cb-desc\">\n<title id=\"cb-title\">把专业场景画出来：井下破岩、携屑返出、取样与成像</title><desc id=\"cb-desc\">蓝色路径表示钻井液沿钻杆内部下行，绿色路径表示岩屑随返出液沿环空上返。地面振动筛分离岩屑，采样、清洗并记录编号后在受控光照下成像。样品井深需要迟到校正。</desc>\n<defs><pattern id=\"cb-shale\" width=\"24\" height=\"16\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 5h15M9 13h15\" stroke=\"#9caeb2\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".5\"/></pattern><pattern id=\"cb-lime\" width=\"35\" height=\"22\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 0h35v22H0Z M17 0v11M0 11h35\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a7b69f\" opacity=\".4\"/></pattern><marker id=\"cb-arrow\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L7 3.5 0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5a9b86\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#2e7d67\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\">01 / 井下破岩与循环</text><text x=\"441\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#2e7d67\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\">02 / 地面取样与追溯</text><text x=\"792\" y=\"35\" fill=\"#2e7d67\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\">03 / 受控成像与输入</text>\n<path d=\"M401 60V490M758 60V490\" stroke=\"#dce7df\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 7\"/>\n<!-- Geological section: textures distinguish conceptual strata, not labels inferred from colour. -->\n<rect x=\"30\" y=\"215\" width=\"344\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#e9dcc0\"/><circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"249\" r=\"1.0\" fill=\"#b29664\" opacity=\".35\"/><circle cx=\"73\" cy=\"249\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"#b29664\" opacity=\".35\"/><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"249\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#b29664\" opacity=\